body:
### Tested versions

Tested in Godot v4.5.1.stable , 4.7.2.stable

### System information

Godot v4.5.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 6GB Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8157) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-13420H (12 threads) - 15.63 GiB memory

### Issue description

I tried to create a custom `TextServer` for testing purposes and noticed a few inconsistencies

| TextServerExtension Doc | TextServerExtension CC | TextServer(Advanced) Doc |
| --- | --- | --- |
| <img width="462" height="43" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06c3b0d6-1d0a-4a50-8c3d-a777869a3549" /> | <img width="375" height="46" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dca8b1a5-8a6e-4e3b-928c-a59b7bb5cf21" /> | <img width="403" height="48" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32e38f37-86c3-4017-8481-2af936cdbb03" /> |
| <img width="419" height="54" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/30a66209-3d8b-4531-8265-41e87c125cbd" /> | <img width="303" height="46" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f945de65-aef9-4f75-90c5-e0b89fc4d6c9" /> | <img width="353" height="55" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/58379f37-f9d5-4a9e-8f1d-afd76c08b445" /> |
| <img width="389" height="54" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a1e68a4-d11e-474b-9fb4-0acb17bacbfb" /> | <img width="317" height="50" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f3aa14b7-772f-453d-b966-2709e168769a" /> | <img width="334" height="59" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb47bcf8-4446-4e82-b790-1797fef93da9" /> |

After I overwrite all required methods with the `TextServerAdvanced` fallback, I get this error:
```
E 0:00:12:690   text_server.gd:201 @ _shaped_text_add_string(): Parameter "_get_font_data(p_fonts[i])" is null.
  <C++ Source>  modules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp:4919 @ _shaped_text_add_string()
  <Stack Trace> text_server.gd:201 @ _shaped_text_add_string()
```
```gdscript
class_name CustomTextServer
extends TextServerExtension


static var singleton: CustomTextServer

var server: TextServerAdvanced


static func _static_init() -> void:
	singleton = CustomTextServer.new()
	TextServerManager.set_primary_interface(singleton)


static func init() -> void:
	pass # dummy method for _static_init call


func _init() -> void:
	server = TextServerAdvanced.new()


func _create_font() -> RID:
	return server.create_font()


func _create_shaped_text(direction: Direction, orientation: Orientation) -> RID:
	return server.create_shaped_text(direction, orientation)

#... all other required methods
```

